Native OCaml Core for PRAXO-CORE: JSON, tool calls, JSON Schema subset,
plugin manifests, policy hooks, memory, checkpoints, context compaction,
middleware, events, MCP client boundary, and an agent loop. No Go runtime or
provider adapter is required. The public module is Praxo_core; OCaml module
names cannot contain a hyphen.
